{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c9gkDpl9pjai1gHQxGBCNA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:38.193094+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c9gkDpl9pjai1gHQxGBCNA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>简   介</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>中国舰船研究设计中心，是我国舰船总体研究设计单位，是我国舰船装备研制“国家队”，被誉为“战舰摇篮”。中心本部位于湖北省武汉市，在上海市设有分部。现有专业技术人员近2000名，其中硕士研究生以上学历占比超过80%，拥有中国工程院院士2名，国家百千万人才、全国优秀科技工作者、享受国务院政府专项津贴专家、省部级专家100余人次，硕/博士导师30余人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>中国舰船研究设计中心主要从事舰船总体研究设计，设有总体研究室（部）、专业研究室，建有海洋装备电磁效应及安全全国重点实验室、声隐身技术国防重点实验室。先后多次荣获国家科技进步特等奖4项、一等奖8项，省部级以上科技奖励900余项。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本中心设有</span><span><strong><span>船舶与海洋结构物设计制造博士点/硕士点、工程力学硕士点、舰船电磁兼容技术硕士点以及机械、电子信息专业型博士点/硕士点</span></strong></span><span>。本中心学术严谨，课题资源丰富，能够提供优质的科研实践项目，在读期间待遇优厚。</span></span><span><span>欢迎广大重点高校优秀毕业生免试攻读或报考我中心（</span></span><span><span><strong><span>招生代码:86203</span></strong></span></span><span><span>）硕士研究生。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dN3ibRtoNez9JV3iatia2u1xrIx5aT3znR1TJRAiaKTibpYYbR4lMYD1yvLNpPEyyNmiaYfZ5f0w531L4IeuJ1ZH4h4ia0o4C9fdYgrGGKTrPqwb6s/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>2027年招生专业人数</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><span><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></td><td><span><strong><span>研究方向</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong><strong></strong></span></td><td><span><strong><span>招生人数</span></strong></span></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><section><span><span>（082401）船舶与海洋结构物设计</span></span><span><span>制造</span></span><span><span>（学术型硕士）</span></span></section></td><td><section><span><span>智能控制、人工智能</span></span></section></td><td><span><span>4</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><section><span><span>舰船动力系统</span></span></section></td><td><span><span>1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>振动噪声控制</span></span></td><td><span><span>1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><section><span><span>（085501）机械工程（专业型硕士）</span></span></section></td><td><section><span><span>船舶动力系统</span></span></section></td><td><span><span>1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><section><span><span>（085401）新一代电子信息技术（专业型硕士）</span></span></section></td><td><section><span><span>电磁兼容</span></span></section></td><td><span><span>4</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><section><span><span>（085406）控制工程（专业型硕士）</span></span></section></td><td><section><span><span>舰船信息系统</span></span></section></td><td><span><span>2</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><section><span><span>（085410）人工智能（专业型硕士）</span></span></section></td><td><section><span><span>人工智能</span></span></section></td><td><span><span>2</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>所学专业要求</span></stron